{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/379251-2-5e-solar-and-amnesia-drugs","id":379251,"title":"2.5e solar and amnesia drugs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-23T11:44:32-08:00","id":379251,"title":"2.5e solar and amnesia drugs","content":"Because this became a suddenly relevant question, how does an essence 3 solar beat mind-altering drugs? I was thinking Transcendant Hero's Meditation, but that's e4. Would an Integrity or Resistance roll beat memory alteration? I should mention the alteration occurred years ago.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Don't feel bad. People tell the developers they get Exalted wrong all the time. -hippokrene","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4729-childofthesun1","name":"Childofthesun1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4729_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"853"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T12:01:43-08:00","id":379296,"title":"","content":"My advice - don't look for a specific existing charm or artifact. Make up something appropriate to the plot of your story instead.<br /> <br /> I suggest meditation in a garden combined with acupuncture therapy by a sagely mentor figure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T12:33:44-08:00","id":379376,"title":"","content":"I agree with semicasual. Finding or inventing a Charm to fix the problem outright is kind of a boring story. You're essentially just making another Problem-Solving Prana. There are plenty of Solar Resistance and Integrity Charms that could defend against the amnesia while it happens, but even in 2e's height I don't believe there was ever a Charm that could straight-up undo something that happened years ago. (That Solar Medicine Charm that regrows limbs notwithstanding)<br /> <br /> Go instead with story scenes:<ul><li>Trip out on hallucinogenic drugs from the middlemarches, journeying deep into the recesses of her own mind to confront whatever has sealed the memory away.</li> <li>Make questionable bargains with a powerful sorcerer who can reconstruct those faded memories in exchange for another, more cherished one.</li> <li>Gain the favor of a spirit that can show brief glimpses of forgotten ideas in dreams whenever the moon is full.</li> <li>Journey deep into the Labyrinth where the metaphorical ghost of those memories still lingers, and demand it return.</li> <li>Stumble across a fantastic manse from the height of the High First Age, that has the capability of reaching deep into the past to show long-forgotten events in a grand reflecting pool, but is missing a crucial catalyst that hasn't been seen in centuries.</li> </ul>Stuff like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Playing 3e and miss Anathema? Try my web app, <a href=\"https://www.lotcastingatemi.com\" target=\"_blank\">Lot-Casting Atemi</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/553-hushnowquietnow","name":"hushnowquietnow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar553_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"250"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}